<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>MTRAG corpus statistics. <sup id="S4.T1.4" class="ltx_sup">†</sup>FiQA contains
individual forum posts.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Task A Configuration.</h5>

<div id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rewriting strategies use DeepSeek-V3.2 (<math id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau{=}0.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau{=}0.0</annotation></semantics></math>) with
6 user and 3 assistant turns as context. Each
reformulation retrieves top-100 passages from ELSER v1,
selected after benchmarking 9 alternatives (App. <a href="#A2.SS1" title="B.1 Retriever Comparison ‣ Appendix B Task A: Retrieval Details ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.1</span></a>). Hybrid reranking
uses Cohere Rerank v4 with <math id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}60</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{=}0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{=}0.5</annotation></semantics></math>
(Eq. <a href="#S3.E1" title="In Task A: Multi-Strategy Retrieval ‣ 3 System Overview ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>). The weak-consensus group aggregates HyDE, CoT, and Anchor-Keyword with equal weights (<math id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{\text{internal}}{=}40" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>internal</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{\text{internal}}{=}40</annotation></semantics></math>); final fusion uses corpus-specific weights tuned on dev set (Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Task A Configuration. ‣ 4 Experimental setup ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>); uniform weights yield less than 1% R@5 degradation,
confirming robustness to weight selection (App. <a href="#A2.SS9" title="B.9 Nested RRF Parameters ‣ Appendix B Task A: Retrieval Details ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.9</span></a>).</p>
</div>
