<section id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Question type per domain.</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Question type per domain. ‣ A.1 Development Set ‣ Appendix A Dataset Details ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> reports the three most
frequent question types per domain.
ClapNQ and Govt share a similar profile dominated by Factoid
and Summarization questions, while FiQA is uniquely
characterized by Opinion questions (reflecting its
user-generated forum content) and Cloud distributes more
evenly across types with lower top-3 concentration.
Figure <a href="#A1.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ Question type per domain. ‣ A.1 Development Set ‣ Appendix A Dataset Details ‣ AILS-NTUA at SemEval-2026 Task 8: Evaluating Multi-Turn RAG Conversations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> visualizes the full
question-type distribution across all domains.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T9.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:73.2pt;vertical-align:-33.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(28.2pt,-6.0pt) scale(1.19509279735478,1.19509279735478) ;">
