<th id="A1.T11.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" colspan="3"><em id="A1.T11.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Domain distribution (% of turns)</em></th></tr>
